    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2018_0293","fieldKey":"title"} -->
    <Title>Notes on silence, in three coats of varnish</Title>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2018_0293","fieldKey":"date"} -->
    <Date>2018-06-14</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2018_0293","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Rangi Ulloa talks about a square that refuses to be a square. Halfway through, a visitor asked whether the work was finished. It was not clear that the question had an answer.</Description>
